<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1443355417"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:20.227"><div begin="0.929" end="24.123" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="0.929" end="6.402" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.929" end="1.609">即</span><span begin="1.609" end="2.398">使你</span><span begin="2.398" end="3.098">离</span><span begin="3.098" end="3.732">开</span> <span begin="3.831" end="4.457">我</span><span begin="4.457" end="5.196">热情</span><span begin="5.196" end="5.865">未</span><span begin="5.865" end="6.402">改</span></p><p begin="6.412" end="11.675" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.412" end="7.216">这</span><span begin="7.216" end="7.923">漫长</span><span begin="7.923" end="8.622">夜</span><span begin="8.622" end="9.167">里</span> <span begin="9.275" end="10.623">谁人是你</span><span begin="10.623" end="11.368">所</span><span begin="11.368" end="11.675">爱</span></p><p begin="11.992" end="17.348" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.992" end="12.749">花</span><span begin="12.749" end="13.364">不似</span><span begin="13.364" end="14.148">盛</span><span begin="14.148" end="14.721">开</span> <span begin="14.777" end="15.474">爱</span><span begin="15.474" end="16.202">渐如</span><span begin="16.202" end="16.913">大</span><span begin="16.913" end="17.348">海</span></p><p begin="17.485" end="24.123" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.485" end="18.293">假使</span><span begin="18.293" end="18.977">你</span><span begin="18.977" end="19.636">怀念</span><span begin="19.636" end="20.299">我</span> <span begin="20.394" end="21.821">为何独处</span><span begin="21.821" end="22.737">感</span><span begin="22.737" end="24.123">慨</span></p></div><div begin="51.687" end="1:13.054" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="51.687" end="55.933" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.687" end="52.420">但我</span><span begin="52.420" end="53.423">不</span><span begin="53.475" end="53.760">懂</span><span begin="53.760" end="55.147">说将</span><span begin="55.147" end="55.933">来</span></